ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, July to August is the driest pair on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids at 1.03 inches of normal, and it came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 27% of normal in July to August and 32% in June to July. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 54% of normal on the middle. Grid 29727 had its driest year in 2013 at 56%.</p>"}
